    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## MiniMax H3 (reference-to-video)\n\nOmni-modal video model: up to 15s of 24fps video with native stereo audio\n(dialog in 11 languages). Requires ComfyUI 0.30.0+.\n\n`length` is a frame count at 24fps, snapped up to the model's 17k+5 grid\n(124 = ~5s, trained range is ~124-362 = ~5-15s). Canvas max is 768x1344-area\n(~1MP); this workflow defaults to 864x480 (~0.4MP, the\nofficial template default).\n\nThe `MiniMaxH3MemoryEfficientSageAttentionPatch` node (kjnodes) needs the\n`sageattention` pip package on the server; delete or bypass it to run without.\n\n**Models** (from [Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3)):\n\n- `diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n- `text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors`\n- `vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors`\n- `vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors`\n"
   ],
   "title": "About this workflow"
  }
